Should be capable of working towards realizing the vision and mission of the University;
Should be able to attract research grants and complementary funds from local and international agencies, for the development of the University;
Should possess outstanding personal integrity in the management of funds and be able to deploy financial resources as appropriate in the context of strategic plans of the University;
Must demonstrate inter personal and team building skills and possess the ability to harness all component units and resources in building an enviable university system;
Should be an individual who judging from his/her track records is likely to earn the respect as well as loyalty of the members of staff,students and University community;
Should be in a position to ensure the enforcement of the University Law and Regulations;
Should have excellent and spoken communication skills;
Should be Information and Communication Technology (ICY) proficient;
